meta {
  name: Create Organization
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orgs
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Dev-User-ID: {{devUserId}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "slug": "gemeente-voorbeeld",
    "display_name": "Gemeente Voorbeeld",
    "contact_email": "ai-team@voorbeeld.example.nl"
  }
}

docs {
  Provisions a new organisation tenant. PlatformAdmin only.

  Validation / behaviour:
    1. Authentication required; PlatformAdmin role enforced.
    2. slug must match ^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{1,38}[a-z0-9]$ (3–40 chars, kebab-case).
    3. display_name and contact_email are required non-empty strings.
    4. Persist Organisation row.
    5. Write org.created to audit_logs.

  Responses:
    201 created       — full org object
    401 unauthorized  — unauthenticated
    422 validation_failed — slug format invalid or required field missing
    409 slug_taken    — an organisation with that slug already exists
}
